(3605135, 504618, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice perspective to add the symmetry - the colors are nice but the shadows across the pier seem to destroy the symmetry actually present.  Still a 7 for a good photo</td>', 'nice perspective to add the symmetry - the colors are nice but the shadows across the pier seem to destroy the symmetry actually present.  Still a 7 for a good photo', '2007-05-02 10:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
