(3607164, 503590, 75651, '<td valign="top">cute baby, but not a very well balanced nor simple shot.  Perhaps just a close up of his face would have done well for symmetry, and with a face like that, sure to be a 10!</td>', 'cute baby, but not a very well balanced nor simple shot.  Perhaps just a close up of his face would have done well for symmetry, and with a face like that, sure to be a 10!', '2007-05-02 18:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607178, 505550, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very simple, very balances.  Good lighting.  There is one thing that I will nit-pick though, If you took the shot at a lower angle, the creases in the wall boards in the background, would have stayed on the same angle as the photographs edge, making it even more appealing and giving the viewer a definite sense of balance and stability.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'Very simple, very balances.  Good lighting.  There is one thing that I will nit-pick though, If you took the shot at a lower angle, the creases in the wall boards in the background, would have stayed on the same angle as the photographs edge, making it even more appealing and giving the viewer a definite sense of balance and stability.  Nice shot though.', '2007-05-02 18:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607189, 504243, 75651, '<td valign="top">There is one thing that my professor taught me that I''d like to share.  When taking pictures of benches, wheels, etc.  be sure to include the stability of that object to the ground.  In other words, the legs to the bench should be in the photo, or else the benches look as though it is floating.</td>', 'There is one thing that my professor taught me that I''d like to share.  When taking pictures of benches, wheels, etc.  be sure to include the stability of that object to the ground.  In other words, the legs to the bench should be in the photo, or else the benches look as though it is floating.', '2007-05-02 18:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607191, 506132, 21124, '<td valign="top">You will probably score low in this challenge, but we have to remember that DPC results are not necessarily representative of real photographic qualities.<br/> <br/>That pic with its title says something, and we have to think about it. That is photography.</td>', 'You will probably score low in this challenge, but we have to remember that DPC results are not necessarily representative of real photographic qualities. That pic with its title says something, and we have to think about it. That is photography.', '2007-05-02 18:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607199, 504236, 75651, '<td valign="top">out of focus a bit.  Very nice flower though.</td>', 'out of focus a bit.  Very nice flower though.', '2007-05-02 18:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3607219, 504436, 75651, '<td valign="top">Now that is depth!  Just not very symmetrical.  If you cut out the city-scape, might have been a bit.  Still a decent photo though.</td>', 'Now that is depth!  Just not very symmetrical.  If you cut out the city-scape, might have been a bit.  Still a decent photo though.', '2007-05-02 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
