(3607827, 502904, 74533, '<td valign="top">This idea would have been better if you had of taken a close up of on of the beautiful coloured leaves on the top right of photo.  Then you could have shown the real symmetry.</td>', 'This idea would have been better if you had of taken a close up of on of the beautiful coloured leaves on the top right of photo.  Then you could have shown the real symmetry.', '2007-05-02 21:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
