(3613432, 506044, 59905, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, though I would''ve liked it to be even better aligned. This gives it a bit of a snapshot-feeling, where perfect symmetry would raise the score I give now by at least two points. Also, the lighting is a bit strange from aright and I think I''d change the white balance. Still, I like the idea and wonder what images you''ll produce in the future! -5-</td>', 'I like this idea, though I would''ve liked it to be even better aligned. This gives it a bit of a snapshot-feeling, where perfect symmetry would raise the score I give now by at least two points. Also, the lighting is a bit strange from aright and I think I''d change the white balance. Still, I like the idea and wonder what images you''ll produce in the future! -5-', '2007-05-04 02:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613437, 505779, 59905, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, the colors seem a bit flat though. Maybe increase the saturation.</td>', 'Nice picture, the colors seem a bit flat though. Maybe increase the saturation.', '2007-05-04 02:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613443, 505888, 59905, '<td valign="top">Very nice, too bad the jpeg conversion can''t cope well with the finest structures (a thing you can''t do anything about though..) The lighting is nice here aswell!</td>', 'Very nice, too bad the jpeg conversion can''t cope well with the finest structures (a thing you can''t do anything about though..) The lighting is nice here aswell!', '2007-05-04 02:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613444, 505951, 74823, '<td valign="top">nice idea, though not very sharp on my screen. i also think that it would have been immediately more visually striking if it had actually been centered to be perfectly symetrical, where this seems off-center and just slightly unbalanced.</td>', 'nice idea, though not very sharp on my screen. i also think that it would have been immediately more visually striking if it had actually been centered to be perfectly symetrical, where this seems off-center and just slightly unbalanced.', '2007-05-04 02:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613445, 504215, 59905, '<td valign="top">This one in my opinion has too much snapshot-power :-S -4-</td>', 'This one in my opinion has too much snapshot-power :-S -4-', '2007-05-04 02:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613447, 505915, 59905, '<td valign="top">The idea is fine, I''ve already seen images that were better executed though. I would like to change white balance, rotate the image a bit, crop so the power tower to right isn''t in view (and the airplane is, it''s a nice addition) and maybe even crop so the top part of the tower in front is totally invisible, as it is now only half in the field of view (which I find annoying). Good luck in the challenges! -3-</td>', 'The idea is fine, I''ve already seen images that were better executed though. I would like to change white balance, rotate the image a bit, crop so the power tower to right isn''t in view (and the airplane is, it''s a nice addition) and maybe even crop so the top part of the tower in front is totally invisible, as it is now only half in the field of view (which I find annoying). Good luck in the challenges! -3-', '2007-05-04 02:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
