(3613469, 503764, 59905, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Nice use of the ''wide screen'' borders. I keep looking whether the center line down the bonnet is exactly vertical (in the image), I think it isn''t. That would''ve made the picture even better. -8-</td>', 'Great shot! Nice use of the ''wide screen'' borders. I keep looking whether the center line down the bonnet is exactly vertical (in the image), I think it isn''t. That would''ve made the picture even better. -8-', '2007-05-04 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613473, 503592, 59905, '<td valign="top">I find this image quite boring. There are only two main colors, there''s no place where the eyes are drawn to and the subject at hand (small leaves and flowers) just don''t do well when compressed as jpeg. Next time, add an object to focus on. -2-</td>', 'I find this image quite boring. There are only two main colors, there''s no place where the eyes are drawn to and the subject at hand (small leaves and flowers) just don''t do well when compressed as jpeg. Next time, add an object to focus on. -2-', '2007-05-04 02:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613477, 506118, 59905, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though I think this image would''ve been way better when the left (and maybe right aswell) edges are cropped, maybe even add a border. This is because the symmetry line that divides the lower and upper half of the image is now cut off. -6-</td>', 'Nice idea, though I think this image would''ve been way better when the left (and maybe right aswell) edges are cropped, maybe even add a border. This is because the symmetry line that divides the lower and upper half of the image is now cut off. -6-', '2007-05-04 02:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613481, 503219, 59905, '<td valign="top">I like the picture a lot, though I keep wondering how well it fits the symmetry part of the challenge... -7-</td>', 'I like the picture a lot, though I keep wondering how well it fits the symmetry part of the challenge... -7-', '2007-05-04 02:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
