(3613490, 504619, 59905, '<td valign="top">Wow what a great use of the DOF! Very strange effect in this case. I do not, however, like the fact that it''s a flower macro, as they seem to be used for almost every challenge... -6-</td>', 'Wow what a great use of the DOF! Very strange effect in this case. I do not, however, like the fact that it''s a flower macro, as they seem to be used for almost every challenge... -6-', '2007-05-04 02:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
