(3613501, 504610, 59905, '<td valign="top">What a great shot and great idea, it''s such a shame that the image is not perfectly symmetric :-( (I suppose you cropped the right side to make the horns leave at the same height, which is good), but I think I''d have cropped most of both horns to ensure the center of the capricorn''s head is in the center of the image.. Great DOF too! -8-</td>', 'What a great shot and great idea, it''s such a shame that the image is not perfectly symmetric :-( (I suppose you cropped the right side to make the horns leave at the same height, which is good), but I think I''d have cropped most of both horns to ensure the center of the capricorn''s head is in the center of the image.. Great DOF too! -8-', '2007-05-04 02:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
