(3613505, 506079, 59905, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea! Next time, align everything perfectly (especially the slinky on the line and the light source perpendicular to the line) and you''ll get a 10 from me :P now it''s an 8</td>', 'Very cool idea! Next time, align everything perfectly (especially the slinky on the line and the light source perpendicular to the line) and you''ll get a 10 from me :P now it''s an 8', '2007-05-04 03:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
