(3613509, 505638, 59905, '<td valign="top">Very clean on the technical part (deep black, nice lighting, almost perfect leaf)</td>', 'Very clean on the technical part (deep black, nice lighting, almost perfect leaf)', '2007-05-04 03:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613512, 505840, 59905, '<td valign="top">Hey!!! Too bad some parts overexposed... and what do you think of the title??? I think,,, three is a crowd ;););) !!!</td>', 'Hey!!! Too bad some parts overexposed... and what do you think of the title??? I think,,, three is a crowd ;););) !!!', '2007-05-04 03:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613526, 504929, 67258, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this, and the subject is one that really appeals to me.  There are a couple of things, in my view, that could have improved it even more:  <br/>1. The focus seems soft - two possible reasons spring to mind, either it is hand held at too low a shutter speed and a bit of camera shake has been introduced or you are focussing a little too far in to the photo.  It may be worth spending a litle time reading up on hyperfocal distances - I struggle with it a bit myself, and am not the best person to explain!  The effect of the soft focus is that the texture of the wood, which would add considerable ineterest, and increase the feeling of depth, has not been brought out. <br/>2.  I like the subdued colour palette, ad there are some wonderful shades in the water, but overall the photo lacks punch and would benefit from some levels adjustment (or if it has had some, a bit more tweaking), nothing major, just subtle adjustments.<br/>Do bear in mind this is very subjective, and is just my opinion, so do take it with a pinch of salt!</td>', 'I love the composition of this, and the subject is one that really appeals to me.  There are a couple of things, in my view, that could have improved it even more:  1. The focus seems soft - two possible reasons spring to mind, either it is hand held at too low a shutter speed and a bit of camera shake has been introduced or you are focussing a little too far in to the photo.  It may be worth spending a litle time reading up on hyperfocal distances - I struggle with it a bit myself, and am not the best person to explain!  The effect of the soft focus is that the texture of the wood, which would add considerable ineterest, and increase the feeling of depth, has not been brought out. 2.  I like the subdued colour palette, ad there are some wonderful shades in the water, but overall the photo lacks punch and would benefit from some levels adjustment (or if it has had some, a bit more tweaking), nothing major, just subtle adjustments.Do bear in mind this is very subjective, and is just my opinion, so do take it with a pinch of salt!', '2007-05-04 03:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613527, 505837, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture and a unique take on the challenge especially with the similarily colored horses. The image is well framed and the heads of the horses are composed nicely using the rule of thirds. A narrower depth of field here would help blur the background a bit more and make it less distracting. <br/> <br/>The exposure is generally good but the sky is a bit bright. Not a lot that could be done about it however if a circular polarize was available it might have helped a bit. <br/> <br/>Good sharpness in the subjects and nice detail in the face and neck especially. <br/> <br/>If I were to shoot this again I would perhaps try a portrait orientation as well and compare.</td>', 'Interesting capture and a unique take on the challenge especially with the similarily colored horses. The image is well framed and the heads of the horses are composed nicely using the rule of thirds. A narrower depth of field here would help blur the background a bit more and make it less distracting.  The exposure is generally good but the sky is a bit bright. Not a lot that could be done about it however if a circular polarize was available it might have helped a bit.  Good sharpness in the subjects and nice detail in the face and neck especially.  If I were to shoot this again I would perhaps try a portrait orientation as well and compare.', '2007-05-04 03:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613528, 505825, 67258, '<td valign="top">I feel this would have fitted the challenge better, and provided a more graphic photograph if you had been directly behind the peacock, rather than at an angle.</td>', 'I feel this would have fitted the challenge better, and provided a more graphic photograph if you had been directly behind the peacock, rather than at an angle.', '2007-05-04 03:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613534, 505842, 67258, '<td valign="top">Woahh - Vertigo inducing! Very different take on a relatively common subject - nice work!  I do like the juxtopisiton of the engineered man-made structure with the natural world.  A photo I will revisit in the future.</td>', 'Woahh - Vertigo inducing! Very different take on a relatively common subject - nice work!  I do like the juxtopisiton of the engineered man-made structure with the natural world.  A photo I will revisit in the future.', '2007-05-04 03:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613537, 505776, 67258, '<td valign="top">Simple but beautiful. Calming, soft, gentle.  A favourite.</td>', 'Simple but beautiful. Calming, soft, gentle.  A favourite.', '2007-05-04 03:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613539, 504243, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well considered composition, with good focus and exposure, but a dull subject that has resulted in, for me, a relatively uninteresting photograph.</td>', 'Well considered composition, with good focus and exposure, but a dull subject that has resulted in, for me, a relatively uninteresting photograph.', '2007-05-04 03:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613546, 504218, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good choice of subject, but you have been a bit too agressive in post-editting.  Of particular note, I would revisit the photo and substantially tone down the saturation.</td>', 'A good choice of subject, but you have been a bit too agressive in post-editting.  Of particular note, I would revisit the photo and substantially tone down the saturation.', '2007-05-04 03:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613555, 506047, 43073, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot; the B&amp;W conversion is wonderful ("spot on", as they say), and the choice of subject matter is interesting, with lots to see if you really look. Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this shot; the B&W conversion is wonderful ("spot on", as they say), and the choice of subject matter is interesting, with lots to see if you really look. Nicely done.', '2007-05-04 03:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613559, 506142, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, and it''s a neat perspective, but the light in the lower center is distracting for me. I might have tried cropping off the bottom to really emphasize the symmetry in the image.</td>', 'I like this shot, and it''s a neat perspective, but the light in the lower center is distracting for me. I might have tried cropping off the bottom to really emphasize the symmetry in the image.', '2007-05-04 03:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613628, 504732, 3942, '<td valign="top">Creative concept and well excecuted. Looks a bit unsarp / out of focus to me. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Creative concept and well excecuted. Looks a bit unsarp / out of focus to me. Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-05-04 04:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613693, 505835, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting memorial, and not one I have seen a photograph of before.  I do feel  that you could perhaps have made more of the subject, ''though. I would suggest that if you ever visit again, you zoom in closer - or better still physically move in closer; the grass that takes up the lower part of the frame doesn''t add anything - all the ineterset is higher up.  I like the shadows, and to my eyes, it is this that adds the most interest - by positioning yourself slightly further to the left you would have ben able to maximise on this potential.</td>', 'This is an interesting memorial, and not one I have seen a photograph of before.  I do feel  that you could perhaps have made more of the subject, ''though. I would suggest that if you ever visit again, you zoom in closer - or better still physically move in closer; the grass that takes up the lower part of the frame doesn''t add anything - all the ineterset is higher up.  I like the shadows, and to my eyes, it is this that adds the most interest - by positioning yourself slightly further to the left you would have ben able to maximise on this potential.', '2007-05-04 06:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613697, 506177, 67258, '<td valign="top">The lighting of this intrigues me, and  do hope you explan your method once voting is over.  A perfectly presented image, my only niggles are with the two small patches of green and purple, lower central, possibly caused by a litle lens flare.  I realise that there is little you can do about these in basic editting, but I feel the image warrants further work outside of the challenge as it certainly has that eye-catching ''wow'' actor.</td>', 'The lighting of this intrigues me, and  do hope you explan your method once voting is over.  A perfectly presented image, my only niggles are with the two small patches of green and purple, lower central, possibly caused by a litle lens flare.  I realise that there is little you can do about these in basic editting, but I feel the image warrants further work outside of the challenge as it certainly has that eye-catching ''wow'' actor.', '2007-05-04 06:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613719, 503592, 66353, '<td valign="top">Symmetry...?   Hmmm - I don''t get it</td>', 'Symmetry...?   Hmmm - I don''t get it', '2007-05-04 06:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613758, 503935, 53509, '<td valign="top">Love the colour, but I''m not sure of the intermittent blurriness works.</td>', 'Love the colour, but I''m not sure of the intermittent blurriness works.', '2007-05-04 07:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613760, 506082, 53509, '<td valign="top">Symmetry well used. I wonder if a bit more detail in the center would have helped.</td>', 'Symmetry well used. I wonder if a bit more detail in the center would have helped.', '2007-05-04 07:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613764, 504761, 53509, '<td valign="top">I think the light is a bit too harsh, and so the bush is too hard to see.</td>', 'I think the light is a bit too harsh, and so the bush is too hard to see.', '2007-05-04 07:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613766, 505914, 53509, '<td valign="top">Just gorgeous!</td>', 'Just gorgeous!', '2007-05-04 07:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613821, 504418, 43073, '<td valign="top">Wonderful find, nicely executed. Excellent use of light for some nice highlights, lovely blues in the sky, good sharpness. Well done!</td>', 'Wonderful find, nicely executed. Excellent use of light for some nice highlights, lovely blues in the sky, good sharpness. Well done!', '2007-05-04 07:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613831, 504973, 43073, '<td valign="top">Good subject, good angle (though I might have cropped a bit more off the bottom to "lose" the black that intrudes on the left bottom), and a really good B&amp;W conversion (I just love the tones you''ve gotten with this).</td>', 'Good subject, good angle (though I might have cropped a bit more off the bottom to "lose" the black that intrudes on the left bottom), and a really good B&W conversion (I just love the tones you''ve gotten with this).', '2007-05-04 08:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613833, 506190, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great image, fitting the topic so well, with good execution (exposure, sharpness, depth), great lighting and colors, and very interesting visually. Nice job.</td>', 'Great image, fitting the topic so well, with good execution (exposure, sharpness, depth), great lighting and colors, and very interesting visually. Nice job.', '2007-05-04 08:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613883, 505861, 54446, '<td valign="top">Magnificent control of exposure and stunning vanishing lines effect.  (10)</td>', 'Magnificent control of exposure and stunning vanishing lines effect.  (10)', '2007-05-04 08:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613896, 505912, 43073, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Simple, yet effective, nice exposure, and a background color and shade that emphasize the main subject. Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this. Simple, yet effective, nice exposure, and a background color and shade that emphasize the main subject. Nicely done.', '2007-05-04 08:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613899, 503968, 74588, '<td valign="top">sheer poetry and a bit spicy    7</td>', 'sheer poetry and a bit spicy    7', '2007-05-04 08:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613901, 504993, 74588, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2007-05-04 08:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613902, 506050, 43073, '<td valign="top">I like this image; subject matter that is both visually interesting and emotionally significant; wonderful colors, nicely exposed, extra interest in the sky by the capture of the moon. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like this image; subject matter that is both visually interesting and emotionally significant; wonderful colors, nicely exposed, extra interest in the sky by the capture of the moon. Nicely done.', '2007-05-04 08:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
