(3613915, 506004, 74588, '<td valign="top">clever   7</td>', 'clever   7', '2007-05-04 08:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613962, 505019, 77364, '<td valign="top">Wish I was where ever this photo was taken!  Awesome colours captured in the sunset.  I like the approach you took to the symmetry challenge - not typical.</td>', 'Wish I was where ever this photo was taken!  Awesome colours captured in the sunset.  I like the approach you took to the symmetry challenge - not typical.', '2007-05-04 09:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613966, 506071, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nature''s symmentry.  It''s probably a matter of opinion, but I find the texture of the background distracting.  However, it does mimic the texture in the star fruit and symmetry is the challenge.  Nice entry!</td>', 'Nature''s symmentry.  It''s probably a matter of opinion, but I find the texture of the background distracting.  However, it does mimic the texture in the star fruit and symmetry is the challenge.  Nice entry!', '2007-05-04 09:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613971, 503298, 77364, '<td valign="top">He''s one mean looking turtle!  I like the blurred out effect all around the turtle, but it''s too bad that the outer portion of the turtle''s shell got blurred out too.  Like the colours in the background - they play off nicely with the colours present in the turtle.  Nice entry</td>', 'He''s one mean looking turtle!  I like the blurred out effect all around the turtle, but it''s too bad that the outer portion of the turtle''s shell got blurred out too.  Like the colours in the background - they play off nicely with the colours present in the turtle.  Nice entry', '2007-05-04 09:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613973, 505330, 18626, '<td valign="top">Very warm photograph ...</td>', 'Very warm photograph ...', '2007-05-04 09:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613974, 505776, 77364, '<td valign="top">Love the intensity and boldness of this photo.   I think it could have made a stronger symmetrical statement if the main, center branch was all in focus - not just the upper half of the branch.  Very nice effort!</td>', 'Love the intensity and boldness of this photo.   I think it could have made a stronger symmetrical statement if the main, center branch was all in focus - not just the upper half of the branch.  Very nice effort!', '2007-05-04 09:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613977, 505895, 18626, '<td valign="top">I do not see the simmetry</td>', 'I do not see the simmetry', '2007-05-04 09:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613979, 505867, 18626, '<td valign="top">A little bit out of focus</td>', 'A little bit out of focus', '2007-05-04 09:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3613981, 504867, 77364, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  It is a very nice photo of the person depicted.  I hope it is a family member because it is an interesting and not so typical.  Nice job!</td>', 'I like the concept.  It is a very nice photo of the person depicted.  I hope it is a family member because it is an interesting and not so typical.  Nice job!', '2007-05-04 09:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614012, 503214, 18626, '<td valign="top">Very nice and intense colors</td>', 'Very nice and intense colors', '2007-05-04 09:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614015, 504628, 43073, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot visually, nicely exposed, with excellent highlights and  appropriate sharpness. I might have liked the crop to be symmetrical as well, but I like it as is, too.</td>', 'A very interesting shot visually, nicely exposed, with excellent highlights and  appropriate sharpness. I might have liked the crop to be symmetrical as well, but I like it as is, too.', '2007-05-04 09:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614021, 504294, 74533, '<td valign="top">A little dark. A stronger contrast would have worked better.  The lines and symmetry a good.</td>', 'A little dark. A stronger contrast would have worked better.  The lines and symmetry a good.', '2007-05-04 09:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614022, 505861, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, with good composition and exposure. I would have been tempted to make this duotone or B&amp;W, but I love the highlight tones toward the end of the walkway, so I''m glad you didn''t. Nicely done!</td>', 'Excellent shot, with good composition and exposure. I would have been tempted to make this duotone or B&W, but I love the highlight tones toward the end of the walkway, so I''m glad you didn''t. Nicely done!', '2007-05-04 09:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614030, 505835, 74533, '<td valign="top">Theres too much picture distracting the viewer from the main subject of the photo.  I would have cropped or gotten closer.</td>', 'Theres too much picture distracting the viewer from the main subject of the photo.  I would have cropped or gotten closer.', '2007-05-04 09:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614031, 504294, 18626, '<td valign="top">More light would have been nice.</td>', 'More light would have been nice.', '2007-05-04 09:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614032, 505368, 74533, '<td valign="top">It would have been great if it was possible to bring out the colours in the stained glass as it all seems a bit neutral.  Love the composition.</td>', 'It would have been great if it was possible to bring out the colours in the stained glass as it all seems a bit neutral.  Love the composition.', '2007-05-04 09:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614035, 506203, 74533, '<td valign="top">Different view of the power line.  Wont you et into trouble being under there?</td>', 'Different view of the power line.  Wont you et into trouble being under there?', '2007-05-04 09:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614039, 505861, 18626, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture</td>', 'Very nice picture', '2007-05-04 09:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614044, 505165, 18626, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture !</td>', 'Very nice picture !', '2007-05-04 09:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614045, 504294, 43073, '<td valign="top">You''ve chosen a great subject, but I would like to see it a bit brighter, and with the upper parts of the building in sharp focus, to bring out the symmetry and give it more of a visual impact.</td>', 'You''ve chosen a great subject, but I would like to see it a bit brighter, and with the upper parts of the building in sharp focus, to bring out the symmetry and give it more of a visual impact.', '2007-05-04 09:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614046, 505880, 18626, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2007-05-04 09:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614049, 505882, 18626, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2007-05-04 09:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614057, 503393, 43073, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. It is visually interesting, with some really neat effects from the glass and the shadows, and nice textures throughout. It is well shot (exposure, sharpness, etc.) to bring it together. It''s a bit different, so I hope you''re not getting low marks, but I really do like it.</td>', 'I really like this image. It is visually interesting, with some really neat effects from the glass and the shadows, and nice textures throughout. It is well shot (exposure, sharpness, etc.) to bring it together. It''s a bit different, so I hope you''re not getting low marks, but I really do like it.', '2007-05-04 09:42:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3614062, 503592, 74533, '<td valign="top">Even though the colours of blue and yellow are a nice contrast there is nothing in this picture that draws my eye which is frustrating.  If the larger yellow flowers almost central to the picture were in focus with everything else in a blur this would have drawn the eye.  I also dont understand is application to the theme Symmetry.</td>', 'Even though the colours of blue and yellow are a nice contrast there is nothing in this picture that draws my eye which is frustrating.  If the larger yellow flowers almost central to the picture were in focus with everything else in a blur this would have drawn the eye.  I also dont understand is application to the theme Symmetry.', '2007-05-04 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614063, 503581, 74533, '<td valign="top">This picture is out of focus and not level.  If the shot had include the entire doorway and had of been in focus it would have scored higher.</td>', 'This picture is out of focus and not level.  If the shot had include the entire doorway and had of been in focus it would have scored higher.', '2007-05-04 09:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614070, 503800, 74533, '<td valign="top">This picture is not in focus.  The idea is good but I dont like the composition of the two items.  I do like the darker background and the blue in the reflections.</td>', 'This picture is not in focus.  The idea is good but I dont like the composition of the two items.  I do like the darker background and the blue in the reflections.', '2007-05-04 09:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614071, 503764, 18626, '<td valign="top">Nice car</td>', 'Nice car', '2007-05-04 09:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614074, 503935, 74533, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but did you shoot this out of focus or did you add the effect later.  Either way it doesn''t really work.  I want to see the butterfly but can''t.</td>', 'I''m sorry but did you shoot this out of focus or did you add the effect later.  Either way it doesn''t really work.  I want to see the butterfly but can''t.', '2007-05-04 09:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614076, 503590, 74533, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I see the symmetry, also out of focus.</td>', 'I''m not sure I see the symmetry, also out of focus.', '2007-05-04 09:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614080, 504729, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot; I love the rust color against the greens. The sky is not perfect here, but symmetry of the bridge really holds my attention in a way that minimizes the sky''s effect. Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent shot; I love the rust color against the greens. The sky is not perfect here, but symmetry of the bridge really holds my attention in a way that minimizes the sky''s effect. Nicely done.', '2007-05-04 09:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614085, 503968, 74533, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and dont like the colour.  Maybe you could have done more of a silouette (spelling?) effect and tried to make the subjects more accurately symmetrical.</td>', 'Out of focus and dont like the colour.  Maybe you could have done more of a silouette (spelling?) effect and tried to make the subjects more accurately symmetrical.', '2007-05-04 09:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614142, 505977, 73032, '<td valign="top">beautiful picture</td>', 'beautiful picture', '2007-05-04 10:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614170, 503342, 73032, '<td valign="top">beaytiful shot.</td>', 'beaytiful shot.', '2007-05-04 10:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3614185, 506155, 73032, '<td valign="top">i like your idea, but it''s kinda fuzzy. Read about DOF, that''s what someone told me to do when I had one like this.</td>', 'i like your idea, but it''s kinda fuzzy. Read about DOF, that''s what someone told me to do when I had one like this.', '2007-05-04 10:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
