(3614664, 503764, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''m often not keen on borders, especially partial ones, but this works so well with the photograph.  The focus is sharp and crisp, the exposure good, and the fron of the car certainly seems to pop.  My only niggle is with the tarmac, especially at top left, which does (in my view) distract from the clean lines of the car.</td>', 'I''m often not keen on borders, especially partial ones, but this works so well with the photograph.  The focus is sharp and crisp, the exposure good, and the fron of the car certainly seems to pop.  My only niggle is with the tarmac, especially at top left, which does (in my view) distract from the clean lines of the car.', '2007-05-04 12:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
