(3616126, 503967, 5792, '<td valign="top"><b>Positives:</b> <br/>This is an improvement over your other submissions. It lacks color noise and sharpness is better and you are working a little shallow depth of field into your photography.<br/> <br/><b>Technicals:</b> <br/>The closest part of the ball is slightly out of focus. Perpective and background are still uninteresting, though. The top of the ball is cut off and the bottom comes to close to the edge of the frame.<br/> <br/><b>The Challenge:</b> <br/>The fact your ball is not really round and that it lacks precise symmetry will probably hurt the image in voting. Symmetry can be achieved in a photograph in a wide variety of ways. There are good examples in the challenge. Looks like the picture was taken with flash and voters typically vote available light images higher in these type situations.<br/> <br/><b>Suggestions:</b> <br/>Instead of just pointing the camera at your subject and taking a picture think about taking the picture from unusual or different angles to make it look more interesting to the viewer. Use available light, like that through a window, whenever possible for a more natural look. There are different ways to frame your subject that will add more viewer interest. Look at the other challenge entries and see if you can learn some of them from the other photograph entries.</td>', 'Positives: This is an improvement over your other submissions. It lacks color noise and sharpness is better and you are working a little shallow depth of field into your photography. Technicals: The closest part of the ball is slightly out of focus. Perpective and background are still uninteresting, though. The top of the ball is cut off and the bottom comes to close to the edge of the frame. The Challenge: The fact your ball is not really round and that it lacks precise symmetry will probably hurt the image in voting. Symmetry can be achieved in a photograph in a wide variety of ways. There are good examples in the challenge. Looks like the picture was taken with flash and voters typically vote available light images higher in these type situations. Suggestions: Instead of just pointing the camera at your subject and taking a picture think about taking the picture from unusual or different angles to make it look more interesting to the viewer. Use available light, like that through a window, whenever possible for a more natural look. There are different ways to frame your subject that will add more viewer interest. Look at the other challenge entries and see if you can learn some of them from the other photograph entries.', '2007-05-04 20:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616137, 505375, 77364, '<td valign="top">there is something about this photo - maybe it''s that the yellow on the flower center picks up the yellowing leaves that I do not like.  It''s definitely symmetrical - you did a nice job with that, it''s just that the whole subject (flowers, leaves and branches) on a whole, looks likes it''s on its way out, fading, past prime.  Nice try.</td>', 'there is something about this photo - maybe it''s that the yellow on the flower center picks up the yellowing leaves that I do not like.  It''s definitely symmetrical - you did a nice job with that, it''s just that the whole subject (flowers, leaves and branches) on a whole, looks likes it''s on its way out, fading, past prime.  Nice try.', '2007-05-04 20:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616143, 506098, 77364, '<td valign="top">Regrettably, I do not see the symmetry in this photo.</td>', 'Regrettably, I do not see the symmetry in this photo.', '2007-05-04 20:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616154, 505593, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but it''s not quite symmetrical.  There is a little more room on the right than the left - the angle is off a bit - just a matter of adjusting your placement in front of the building.  Good use of rule of thirds.</td>', 'Nice try, but it''s not quite symmetrical.  There is a little more room on the right than the left - the angle is off a bit - just a matter of adjusting your placement in front of the building.  Good use of rule of thirds.', '2007-05-04 20:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616157, 506074, 77364, '<td valign="top">Way Cool!  Nice subject.  Very well executed.</td>', 'Way Cool!  Nice subject.  Very well executed.', '2007-05-04 20:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616169, 504776, 77364, '<td valign="top">I am afraid I am not seeing symmetry in this photo.  The colors are a bit washed out too.  I''ll bet it looked fantastic in person, it just did not capture well on the camera.  Good try - keep trying</td>', 'I am afraid I am not seeing symmetry in this photo.  The colors are a bit washed out too.  I''ll bet it looked fantastic in person, it just did not capture well on the camera.  Good try - keep trying', '2007-05-04 20:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616171, 505019, 5792, '<td valign="top">You will want to level your horizon. :)</td>', 'You will want to level your horizon. :)', '2007-05-04 20:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616174, 506054, 77364, '<td valign="top">It is definitely symmetrical, but I am afraid it is a bit boring.  Too bad the sky did not offer more - mother nature did not cooperate.</td>', 'It is definitely symmetrical, but I am afraid it is a bit boring.  Too bad the sky did not offer more - mother nature did not cooperate.', '2007-05-04 20:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616181, 505317, 77364, '<td valign="top">Executed nicely.  I really like this photo despite the fact that power lines are not attractive.  Mother Nature (in the form of cloud placement) worked to your advantage in this one.  Well Done!</td>', 'Executed nicely.  I really like this photo despite the fact that power lines are not attractive.  Mother Nature (in the form of cloud placement) worked to your advantage in this one.  Well Done!', '2007-05-04 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616187, 504355, 77364, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch on the symmetry aspect.  Hate to say it, but its a little boring.  Needs more drama, more pop, more wow factor.  Could really make a statement as artwork for someone who is into music.</td>', 'A bit of a stretch on the symmetry aspect.  Hate to say it, but its a little boring.  Needs more drama, more pop, more wow factor.  Could really make a statement as artwork for someone who is into music.', '2007-05-04 20:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616191, 503935, 77364, '<td valign="top">I am sure it is close to impossible to capture a live butterfly such as you did.  Unfortunatly, it is a bit blurry and out of focus.  The background is very distracting.  Nice try though - keep it up.</td>', 'I am sure it is close to impossible to capture a live butterfly such as you did.  Unfortunatly, it is a bit blurry and out of focus.  The background is very distracting.  Nice try though - keep it up.', '2007-05-04 20:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616198, 506190, 77364, '<td valign="top">almost, almost exactly symmetrical.  Your angle is ever so slightly off.  But that is the only nit-picky comment I could come up with.  Otherwise it is awesome looking.  Nice try</td>', 'almost, almost exactly symmetrical.  Your angle is ever so slightly off.  But that is the only nit-picky comment I could come up with.  Otherwise it is awesome looking.  Nice try', '2007-05-04 20:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616201, 505159, 77364, '<td valign="top">It looks like the blue side is going to slide down onto the red side.  It looks tilted and unfortunatly, looks distracting.  I just want to go ahead and prop up the right side just a smidge.  Nice entry though</td>', 'It looks like the blue side is going to slide down onto the red side.  It looks tilted and unfortunatly, looks distracting.  I just want to go ahead and prop up the right side just a smidge.  Nice entry though', '2007-05-04 20:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616203, 504455, 77364, '<td valign="top">Too bad for the airplane dead smack in the middle.  My eye is drawn to that first and then the rest of the photo.  Nice try.</td>', 'Too bad for the airplane dead smack in the middle.  My eye is drawn to that first and then the rest of the photo.  Nice try.', '2007-05-04 20:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616204, 505521, 77364, '<td valign="top">Perfectly symmetrical.  Nice.!</td>', 'Perfectly symmetrical.  Nice.!', '2007-05-04 20:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616210, 503393, 77364, '<td valign="top">Next time iron the red side! :-)  What''s with the branch?  Did a tree fall down and land on the table?  The two unrelated items are depicting symmetry.  I like the concept - but perhaps if you used two items that were related, it may be more pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Next time iron the red side! :-)  What''s with the branch?  Did a tree fall down and land on the table?  The two unrelated items are depicting symmetry.  I like the concept - but perhaps if you used two items that were related, it may be more pleasing to the eye.', '2007-05-04 20:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616212, 505966, 77364, '<td valign="top">I''ll take a glass of white please - on the rocks.  You did a very nice job with this challenge.  Cool tones.  Looks upscale and classy.</td>', 'I''ll take a glass of white please - on the rocks.  You did a very nice job with this challenge.  Cool tones.  Looks upscale and classy.', '2007-05-04 20:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616216, 503131, 77364, '<td valign="top">I know what you are trying to do, but you did not quite achieve it.  Nice try though.</td>', 'I know what you are trying to do, but you did not quite achieve it.  Nice try though.', '2007-05-04 20:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616224, 504979, 77364, '<td valign="top">These do not look like California cows.  Cows from California are happy cows - at least according to the ad on tv.  My legs actually look like cow legs now that I have had the chance to study them - kinda bulky and thick above the knees.  Thanks to you I am going to see cow legs every time I look down!  All kidding aside - this is a very nice photograph.  Clear and crisp.  Nice job!</td>', 'These do not look like California cows.  Cows from California are happy cows - at least according to the ad on tv.  My legs actually look like cow legs now that I have had the chance to study them - kinda bulky and thick above the knees.  Thanks to you I am going to see cow legs every time I look down!  All kidding aside - this is a very nice photograph.  Clear and crisp.  Nice job!', '2007-05-04 20:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616228, 505447, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject matter.  Looks a littl washed out alongside the lower third of the window, but that not have been avoided.  I like this one a lot.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject matter.  Looks a littl washed out alongside the lower third of the window, but that not have been avoided.  I like this one a lot.', '2007-05-04 20:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616232, 503402, 77364, '<td valign="top">A very nice attempt.  The horizontal line of the extending leaves is slightly off and the flower could have been turned slightly more to the right to achieve perfect symmetry between the petals.  Keep up the good work - I mean it.  I love flower pictures.</td>', 'A very nice attempt.  The horizontal line of the extending leaves is slightly off and the flower could have been turned slightly more to the right to achieve perfect symmetry between the petals.  Keep up the good work - I mean it.  I love flower pictures.', '2007-05-04 20:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616233, 506191, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nicely exectuted, however the bee is slightly rotated, therefore throwing the symmetry off.  Like the soothing effect of the colours.</td>', 'Nicely exectuted, however the bee is slightly rotated, therefore throwing the symmetry off.  Like the soothing effect of the colours.', '2007-05-04 20:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616236, 504275, 77364, '<td valign="top">Wow!  How in focus is that part of the flower (stigma?)?  Amazing!  Unfortunalty, the background is too distracting.  Very nice try though!</td>', 'Wow!  How in focus is that part of the flower (stigma?)?  Amazing!  Unfortunalty, the background is too distracting.  Very nice try though!', '2007-05-04 20:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616239, 504736, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nice effort.  I think I would have cropped the lighpole on the left out and cropped out a third of the right side to make it more symmetrical.  Like the colors.  Good try</td>', 'Nice effort.  I think I would have cropped the lighpole on the left out and cropped out a third of the right side to make it more symmetrical.  Like the colors.  Good try', '2007-05-04 20:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616240, 505847, 77364, '<td valign="top">Symmetrical - yes.  Intersting - not really.</td>', 'Symmetrical - yes.  Intersting - not really.', '2007-05-04 21:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616297, 506185, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good to see Horseshoe Canyon getting more looks. Yours is taken from exactly the same place I''ve taken it from, I recognize the near foreground rocks, except you have a better lense for it than I did. Nicely processed to!</td>', 'Good to see Horseshoe Canyon getting more looks. Yours is taken from exactly the same place I''ve taken it from, I recognize the near foreground rocks, except you have a better lense for it than I did. Nicely processed to!', '2007-05-04 21:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616407, 505019, 63759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Sky</td>', 'Beautiful Sky', '2007-05-04 21:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616414, 504430, 63759, '<td valign="top">where''d the circles on the left come from?</td>', 'where''d the circles on the left come from?', '2007-05-04 21:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616417, 503623, 63759, '<td valign="top">Very Nice</td>', 'Very Nice', '2007-05-04 21:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616680, 506142, 76198, '<td valign="top">Ah, the DC metro. I love it ever so... Can''t wait to get back. <br/> <br/>Nice shot - did you have a tripod or just a really fast lens? Compositionally I think it might have worked a little better with more of the escalator in the shot, but that''s just one man''s opinion...</td>', 'Ah, the DC metro. I love it ever so... Can''t wait to get back.  Nice shot - did you have a tripod or just a really fast lens? Compositionally I think it might have worked a little better with more of the escalator in the shot, but that''s just one man''s opinion...', '2007-05-04 23:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616683, 505883, 76198, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challange; exposure is good and I like the star effect on the light; but it lacks a subject, so ends up pretty flat. Would be nice if the trees were more in focus, too, but maybe that''s motion blur? Looks like you were stopped down pretty far.</td>', 'Certainly meets the challange; exposure is good and I like the star effect on the light; but it lacks a subject, so ends up pretty flat. Would be nice if the trees were more in focus, too, but maybe that''s motion blur? Looks like you were stopped down pretty far.', '2007-05-04 23:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616686, 504430, 76198, '<td valign="top">Very pretty flower; I like the DOF except it''s odd to me that the petals on the left aren''t quite in focus... Did you rotate the picture?</td>', 'Very pretty flower; I like the DOF except it''s odd to me that the petals on the left aren''t quite in focus... Did you rotate the picture?', '2007-05-04 23:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616688, 505776, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, and a nice way to interpret the challenge. I have no complaints or recommendations, so 10.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, and a nice way to interpret the challenge. I have no complaints or recommendations, so 10.', '2007-05-04 23:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616691, 504243, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is basically well done; I''d have gone with a little less DOF I think... Unfortunately the subject itself just isn''t all that interesting to me.</td>', 'This is basically well done; I''d have gone with a little less DOF I think... Unfortunately the subject itself just isn''t all that interesting to me.', '2007-05-04 23:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616698, 506098, 76198, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this meets the challenge, except in the most oblique way (people are basically symmetrical, I guess). It''s a very nice portrait, and I like the color processing; though in my experience when using a "cross-processing" effect on dark hair I like to back out some of the blue - since it''s basic editing challenge maybe that wasn''t possible without throwing the whole thing off.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this meets the challenge, except in the most oblique way (people are basically symmetrical, I guess). It''s a very nice portrait, and I like the color processing; though in my experience when using a "cross-processing" effect on dark hair I like to back out some of the blue - since it''s basic editing challenge maybe that wasn''t possible without throwing the whole thing off.', '2007-05-04 23:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3616708, 504293, 76198, '<td valign="top">Did you intend to enter it in this orientation? I don''t think it works... otherwise a nice picture, very nice light for an interior; could use a subject of some sort.</td>', 'Did you intend to enter it in this orientation? I don''t think it works... otherwise a nice picture, very nice light for an interior; could use a subject of some sort.', '2007-05-04 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
