(3617703, 505587, 77364, '<td valign="top">I like how the black coat and the brown boots play with the colours in the train tressel.  Nice entry for this challenge</td>', 'I like how the black coat and the brown boots play with the colours in the train tressel.  Nice entry for this challenge', '2007-05-05 11:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
