(3617841, 503115, 43400, '<td valign="top">Symmetrical concept that could be much stronger by  (1)position your view and angle in direct center, (2)eliminate the blue cloth background or straighten it, plus smooth out the fabric chess board and (3)rotate the camera a bit clockwise for stronger horizontals. Hope this helps.</td>', 'Symmetrical concept that could be much stronger by  (1)position your view and angle in direct center, (2)eliminate the blue cloth background or straighten it, plus smooth out the fabric chess board and (3)rotate the camera a bit clockwise for stronger horizontals. Hope this helps.', '2007-05-05 12:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
