(3618967, 503131, 34059, '<td valign="top">It is a very creative and nice picture, but the quality is too low and I don''t think that the wide white frame is helping the shot.<br/>I like a lot the hands, their different color and backgrounds, but the central face should have attracted better the attention, be more clear, while especially the stain on the left side of the mouth is quite distracting.<br/>I''m giving you a 5 only because I love the concept so much, but you should try to get a sharper and less grainy picture of the laptop display so next time you can make a better picture. Good luck!</td>', 'It is a very creative and nice picture, but the quality is too low and I don''t think that the wide white frame is helping the shot.I like a lot the hands, their different color and backgrounds, but the central face should have attracted better the attention, be more clear, while especially the stain on the left side of the mouth is quite distracting.I''m giving you a 5 only because I love the concept so much, but you should try to get a sharper and less grainy picture of the laptop display so next time you can make a better picture. Good luck!', '2007-05-05 20:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
