(3619840, 505837, 77250, '<td valign="top">I see that you took my advice and went for the symmetry category on this one.  I looked up your last shot and I can tell that this one is different.  Its great for the category but I think the tones and exposure on your last image was a bit better than this one.  8 for content.</td>', 'I see that you took my advice and went for the symmetry category on this one.  I looked up your last shot and I can tell that this one is different.  Its great for the category but I think the tones and exposure on your last image was a bit better than this one.  8 for content.', '2007-05-06 03:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
