(3619948, 505050, 53964, '<td valign="top">I love the composition.  The opposition of the lines of wood and water accentuate the differences in colour and texture.<br/>To bring that out even more, I''d try boosting the saturation a little on the red channel to give the wood a bit richer shade, and tweaking the levels a touch. Raising the midrange a bit would allow a little more contrast while still showing lovely detail in the textures. <br/>I wouldn''t want to see any dramatic changes though... it''s a lovely, peaceful shot :)</td>', 'I love the composition.  The opposition of the lines of wood and water accentuate the differences in colour and texture.To bring that out even more, I''d try boosting the saturation a little on the red channel to give the wood a bit richer shade, and tweaking the levels a touch. Raising the midrange a bit would allow a little more contrast while still showing lovely detail in the textures. I wouldn''t want to see any dramatic changes though... it''s a lovely, peaceful shot :)', '2007-05-06 05:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3619951, 502904, 53964, '<td valign="top">Nature is amazing :)<br/>I find the shot a little busy though, and the dark foreground leaf distracting. It may have been more effective if you could have concentrated more on one set of leaves.</td>', 'Nature is amazing :)I find the shot a little busy though, and the dark foreground leaf distracting. It may have been more effective if you could have concentrated more on one set of leaves.', '2007-05-06 05:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3619962, 506004, 53964, '<td valign="top">I see a face with bigggg eyes :)<br/>Perhaps boosting midrange levels a bit would help bring this out stronger and help counteract the natural reaction of tipping the head to see it as the mind knows it nature created it?</td>', 'I see a face with bigggg eyes :)Perhaps boosting midrange levels a bit would help bring this out stronger and help counteract the natural reaction of tipping the head to see it as the mind knows it nature created it?', '2007-05-06 05:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
