(3619972, 505841, 64086, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the green leaf against the weathered old wood. Parts of the wood look a bit out of focus and I don''t think this adds to the photo. A bit more depth of field or a more parallel angle to the surface would bring clarity to the wood.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the green leaf against the weathered old wood. Parts of the wood look a bit out of focus and I don''t think this adds to the photo. A bit more depth of field or a more parallel angle to the surface would bring clarity to the wood.', '2007-05-06 06:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3619974, 504536, 64086, '<td valign="top">I think the background is too busy with the other cars telephone pole and this detracts from the symmetry of the cars. A shallow DOF would blur out the background and bring greater importance to the subject.</td>', 'I think the background is too busy with the other cars telephone pole and this detracts from the symmetry of the cars. A shallow DOF would blur out the background and bring greater importance to the subject.', '2007-05-06 06:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3619975, 505846, 64086, '<td valign="top">This is a brilliant idea and wonderfully executed. The lighting and composition are fantastic. My only very minor criticism is the small dip between the black and white background around where the 3rd seed is. Great job.</td>', 'This is a brilliant idea and wonderfully executed. The lighting and composition are fantastic. My only very minor criticism is the small dip between the black and white background around where the 3rd seed is. Great job.', '2007-05-06 06:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3619992, 505880, 73981, '<td valign="top">Out of focus from what I can see. An interesting subject though. Getting a bit closer to one of the pedals, or getting it in focus would have given it a better score.</td>', 'Out of focus from what I can see. An interesting subject though. Getting a bit closer to one of the pedals, or getting it in focus would have given it a better score.', '2007-05-06 07:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3619994, 505638, 73981, '<td valign="top">Very nice sharp shot. I wonder what this would''ve looked like in color. Still, the B&amp;W certainly didn''t hurt your score from me. 8</td>', 'Very nice sharp shot. I wonder what this would''ve looked like in color. Still, the B&W certainly didn''t hurt your score from me. 8', '2007-05-06 07:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3619998, 503192, 73981, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Personally, and this is just my own take on it, I would have cropped it from just above the gate where the black starts. I would''ve scored you higher if you had done that. 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice shot. Personally, and this is just my own take on it, I would have cropped it from just above the gate where the black starts. I would''ve scored you higher if you had done that. 6 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620001, 504591, 73981, '<td valign="top">It must have taken some serious patients to get in close on this shot. I would have gone B&amp;W maybe, I don''t know if you tried that.</td>', 'It must have taken some serious patients to get in close on this shot. I would have gone B&W maybe, I don''t know if you tried that.', '2007-05-06 07:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620002, 504430, 73981, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp clear shot. I''ve seen so many flowers this time around which has been a bit exauhsting but this picture feels different. 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice crisp clear shot. I''ve seen so many flowers this time around which has been a bit exauhsting but this picture feels different. 7 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
