(3620004, 504960, 73981, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure it would''ve been possible for you but I think I would''ve scored you better had the background not been what looks like the windows. Not everyone has access to studios, but a I think dropping down a bit of light cloth behind your subject so that we can focus on just the flowers would''ve scored you better. 6 here.</td>', 'I''m not sure it would''ve been possible for you but I think I would''ve scored you better had the background not been what looks like the windows. Not everyone has access to studios, but a I think dropping down a bit of light cloth behind your subject so that we can focus on just the flowers would''ve scored you better. 6 here.', '2007-05-06 07:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620005, 506008, 73981, '<td valign="top">I actually like that the image is shown this way. I''m not sure if that was an accident (I doubt it was) but because it gave it a different feel, I gave it a whole point higher than I would have otherwise. 7 from me.</td>', 'I actually like that the image is shown this way. I''m not sure if that was an accident (I doubt it was) but because it gave it a different feel, I gave it a whole point higher than I would have otherwise. 7 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620007, 504435, 73981, '<td valign="top">Were you in a boat. Beautiful shot. I don''t know that it would''ve been possible but perhaps playing around a bit in PS to see if you could get more contrast our of the reflection would''ve been nice. I don''t know that it would''ve been possible. Still a beauty. 8 from me.</td>', 'Were you in a boat. Beautiful shot. I don''t know that it would''ve been possible but perhaps playing around a bit in PS to see if you could get more contrast our of the reflection would''ve been nice. I don''t know that it would''ve been possible. Still a beauty. 8 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620009, 506172, 73981, '<td valign="top">Makes me wanna go out and watch spider-man. The web of wires looks pretty cool. Good choice of color in the picture as well IMO.</td>', 'Makes me wanna go out and watch spider-man. The web of wires looks pretty cool. Good choice of color in the picture as well IMO.', '2007-05-06 07:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620010, 505129, 73981, '<td valign="top">Not that you have much of a choice, but the tats through me off a bit. It''s still a great shot and I wish I had the body to be able to do that.</td>', 'Not that you have much of a choice, but the tats through me off a bit. It''s still a great shot and I wish I had the body to be able to do that.', '2007-05-06 07:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620012, 503590, 73981, '<td valign="top">DNMC in my opinion. I''m not seeing the symmetry. If someone points it out by the end of the challenge I may feel bad afterwards. I would score 0 on that, but the kid is cute, so you get points for trying to make something out of it. 3 from me.</td>', 'DNMC in my opinion. I''m not seeing the symmetry. If someone points it out by the end of the challenge I may feel bad afterwards. I would score 0 on that, but the kid is cute, so you get points for trying to make something out of it. 3 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620013, 506189, 73981, '<td valign="top">A bit on the dark side. Perhaps a longer shutter speed to allow for more light? I don''t know. It certainly meets the challenge. I''d head back and try it again at a longer shutter speed just to see if I could get it to come out brighter. 7 from me.</td>', 'A bit on the dark side. Perhaps a longer shutter speed to allow for more light? I don''t know. It certainly meets the challenge. I''d head back and try it again at a longer shutter speed just to see if I could get it to come out brighter. 7 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620014, 504133, 73981, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot. I love roads like this, and there certainly aren''t any here in Japan. I would''ve moved up a bit more. The trees on the right are throwing things off balance to the trees on the left. The third tree up on the right seems like a good place to be. It''s hard to tell that from there you wouldn''t get the same thing happening on the other side. 7 from me.</td>', 'Very beautiful shot. I love roads like this, and there certainly aren''t any here in Japan. I would''ve moved up a bit more. The trees on the right are throwing things off balance to the trees on the left. The third tree up on the right seems like a good place to be. It''s hard to tell that from there you wouldn''t get the same thing happening on the other side. 7 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620017, 503681, 73981, '<td valign="top">Good imagination. It''s shots like these that always get me to thinking ''Why didn''t I think of that.'' I don''t know where you layed your book down but I might have chosen some place else. The blue on the left is quite dark and moves into a lighter blue on the right. The center light is also not so centered. Just minor details that keep it from a better score. 7 from me. Good job.</td>', 'Good imagination. It''s shots like these that always get me to thinking ''Why didn''t I think of that.'' I don''t know where you layed your book down but I might have chosen some place else. The blue on the left is quite dark and moves into a lighter blue on the right. The center light is also not so centered. Just minor details that keep it from a better score. 7 from me. Good job.', '2007-05-06 07:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620021, 505159, 73981, '<td valign="top">Great idea. As strange as this sounds, the lights used on the board make it hard to see any of the details in the board. If I had the idea (And I really wish more ideas like this would come to me) I would''ve probably taken a shot from the top looking down and then grayscaled it. I''m going to try this myself and see how it looks, not that I can enter it. I still like the idea though. 6 from me.</td>', 'Great idea. As strange as this sounds, the lights used on the board make it hard to see any of the details in the board. If I had the idea (And I really wish more ideas like this would come to me) I would''ve probably taken a shot from the top looking down and then grayscaled it. I''m going to try this myself and see how it looks, not that I can enter it. I still like the idea though. 6 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620027, 505966, 73981, '<td valign="top">Man...and I have so many of these at home. Why is it that I can''t look at things like this and say "Here''s my entry.". Nice picture. I would have used a more solid background so that I can focus more on the subject...not that the background is really distracting. 7 from me.</td>', 'Man...and I have so many of these at home. Why is it that I can''t look at things like this and say "Here''s my entry.". Nice picture. I would have used a more solid background so that I can focus more on the subject...not that the background is really distracting. 7 from me.', '2007-05-06 07:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620028, 505979, 73981, '<td valign="top">I personally like the use of empty space here. However, a little wrinkle in the water around the log (Had you thrown a stone and taken the shot) might have created a more dramatic image. 7 from me because I like empty space.</td>', 'I personally like the use of empty space here. However, a little wrinkle in the water around the log (Had you thrown a stone and taken the shot) might have created a more dramatic image. 7 from me because I like empty space.', '2007-05-06 07:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620039, 504455, 73981, '<td valign="top">Vancouver again, gotta love the city. (Hope I can go home soon). Nice shot, but the bird or plane (I don''t know which it is) is a bit distracting. Not a lot of color here, so it feels a little flat. Greyscaling it might have scored you higher with me. 6 from me.</td>', 'Vancouver again, gotta love the city. (Hope I can go home soon). Nice shot, but the bird or plane (I don''t know which it is) is a bit distracting. Not a lot of color here, so it feels a little flat. Greyscaling it might have scored you higher with me. 6 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620040, 504536, 73981, '<td valign="top">Nice effort. The imgae is a bit boring and the colors a bit faded. I know you probably couldn''t have moved these cars a bit closer together, but if you take a look at some of the other car shots, you''ll see why they scored higher (More color, more impact). Also, the symmetry is off. 5 for effort.</td>', 'Nice effort. The imgae is a bit boring and the colors a bit faded. I know you probably couldn''t have moved these cars a bit closer together, but if you take a look at some of the other car shots, you''ll see why they scored higher (More color, more impact). Also, the symmetry is off. 5 for effort.', '2007-05-06 08:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620041, 504287, 73981, '<td valign="top">Very sharp image. I like what you were going for here. I would''ve cropped it from the start of the building and gotten rid of as much of the lawn and trees on the left as possible. 6 from me.</td>', 'Very sharp image. I like what you were going for here. I would''ve cropped it from the start of the building and gotten rid of as much of the lawn and trees on the left as possible. 6 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620045, 503352, 73981, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you did to the image but it looks very blocky with the white. Did you maybe over-sharpen the image? If you could''ve gotten a clearer shot of the tower, while keep that sky the way it is, you would have scored much better IMO. 3 from me.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you did to the image but it looks very blocky with the white. Did you maybe over-sharpen the image? If you could''ve gotten a clearer shot of the tower, while keep that sky the way it is, you would have scored much better IMO. 3 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620047, 503728, 73981, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Simple too (Although I think it might have taken time to actually setup the shot). I like the idea and there''s not much I can say that would help. If I were to be super picky I would say that on the left of the bottle there seems to be a smudge of some kind on the background. Not sure what that is. 9 from me.</td>', 'Great idea. Simple too (Although I think it might have taken time to actually setup the shot). I like the idea and there''s not much I can say that would help. If I were to be super picky I would say that on the left of the bottle there seems to be a smudge of some kind on the background. Not sure what that is. 9 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620048, 504275, 73981, '<td valign="top">That center piece feels like it''s popping out of the screen at me. Almost 3D like. Nice image.</td>', 'That center piece feels like it''s popping out of the screen at me. Almost 3D like. Nice image.', '2007-05-06 08:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620053, 505974, 73981, '<td valign="top">IR filter? I love IR and can''t wait to do it myself. I think you lost some detail in the building. Hindesite is 2020 but I would''ve put something in the middle of the path like a yellow rubber duck, and cut the house out of it completely. The path itself is very nice, but would''ve made a boring shot on it''s own. However, had you put something (Anything really) in the middle of the path, you would have score much better I think. I do realize that that is not the shot you were going for here, but perhaps for another challenge you could. 7 from me.</td>', 'IR filter? I love IR and can''t wait to do it myself. I think you lost some detail in the building. Hindesite is 2020 but I would''ve put something in the middle of the path like a yellow rubber duck, and cut the house out of it completely. The path itself is very nice, but would''ve made a boring shot on it''s own. However, had you put something (Anything really) in the middle of the path, you would have score much better I think. I do realize that that is not the shot you were going for here, but perhaps for another challenge you could. 7 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620057, 506024, 73981, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure what I was looking at. Had to get my wife here to point out that they are chairs (They are chairs right?). Definitely meets the challenge, but it''s kind of boring. Nice try though! 5 from me.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure what I was looking at. Had to get my wife here to point out that they are chairs (They are chairs right?). Definitely meets the challenge, but it''s kind of boring. Nice try though! 5 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620059, 506071, 73981, '<td valign="top">Is it me, or is there a lot of noise in this picture. It is a nice picture but I would be careful of noise. That, or the star fruit is super small and we''re getting in close to your skin and that''s just the texture of the skin. 6 from me.</td>', 'Is it me, or is there a lot of noise in this picture. It is a nice picture but I would be careful of noise. That, or the star fruit is super small and we''re getting in close to your skin and that''s just the texture of the skin. 6 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620060, 503623, 73981, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Love the B&amp;W. I can''t really give much advice on a good photo like so I''m just going to say job well done. 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice idea. Love the B&W. I can''t really give much advice on a good photo like so I''m just going to say job well done. 7 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620061, 505977, 73981, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great idea. Being picky, it''s too bad you couldn''t do something about the background. 8 from me.</td>', 'Great shot, great idea. Being picky, it''s too bad you couldn''t do something about the background. 8 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620063, 505768, 78062, '<td valign="top">It''s not exactly symettrical... nice green colour though but a shame the sky isn''t very blue to add a nice feel to it. I think the blue at the top and the green at the bottom wouldve worked well with the dark band of trees in the centre.</td>', 'It''s not exactly symettrical... nice green colour though but a shame the sky isn''t very blue to add a nice feel to it. I think the blue at the top and the green at the bottom wouldve worked well with the dark band of trees in the centre.', '2007-05-06 08:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620066, 503752, 73981, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, great symmetry and another one where B&amp;W do justice. Because it''s a nice shot, it''s hard to give any useful comments. I will be picky and say that some of the lights look a bit blown, but I don''t know that you could control that. Also, the windown on the left side seems to be darker near the bottom and throughout really. 9 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, great symmetry and another one where B&W do justice. Because it''s a nice shot, it''s hard to give any useful comments. I will be picky and say that some of the lights look a bit blown, but I don''t know that you could control that. Also, the windown on the left side seems to be darker near the bottom and throughout really. 9 from me.', '2007-05-06 08:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620067, 505083, 78062, '<td valign="top">Is that sensor dust at the top centre? <br/> <br/>A very clever pic though and nicely captured too.</td>', 'Is that sensor dust at the top centre?  A very clever pic though and nicely captured too.', '2007-05-06 08:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
