(3620077, 505377, 73981, '<td valign="top">The photo seems flat and not that interesting. Grayscaling it might have made it score better with me. Or even adding food coloring to the water to give it more ''punch''. 4 from me. Keep it up though, I don''t think I could''ve done better if I had entered this challenge.</td>', 'The photo seems flat and not that interesting. Grayscaling it might have made it score better with me. Or even adding food coloring to the water to give it more ''punch''. 4 from me. Keep it up though, I don''t think I could''ve done better if I had entered this challenge.', '2007-05-06 08:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620078, 505165, 78062, '<td valign="top">Funky. This would look great in a waiting room or something similar. Sharp focus all the way to the back and I like how the whole image is just white and blue. I personally would have liked a wider angle to catch the tops of the trees but I like it.</td>', 'Funky. This would look great in a waiting room or something similar. Sharp focus all the way to the back and I like how the whole image is just white and blue. I personally would have liked a wider angle to catch the tops of the trees but I like it.', '2007-05-06 08:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
