(3620090, 506133, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. Good angle. Makes it seem more imposing and permament that it otherwise could have been. I actually think the grey sky helps maintain the industrial atmosphere about this shot.</td>', 'Nice pic. Good angle. Makes it seem more imposing and permament that it otherwise could have been. I actually think the grey sky helps maintain the industrial atmosphere about this shot.', '2007-05-06 08:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
