(3620206, 505239, 42713, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!</td>', 'Excellent shot!', '2007-05-06 09:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620209, 504639, 73981, '<td valign="top">I''m very interested in knowing how you did this. Did you crop it a bit short or was there something that was messing up the lower half of the shot? 9 from me.</td>', 'I''m very interested in knowing how you did this. Did you crop it a bit short or was there something that was messing up the lower half of the shot? 9 from me.', '2007-05-06 09:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620211, 505568, 73981, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear. I like the shot. B&amp;W was a good choice for this shot.</td>', 'Crisp and clear. I like the shot. B&W was a good choice for this shot.', '2007-05-06 09:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620217, 506132, 42713, '<td valign="top">What a powerful shot.  Excellent concept and beautiful work.</td>', 'What a powerful shot.  Excellent concept and beautiful work.', '2007-05-06 09:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620313, 506172, 77364, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  The sky totally cooperated for you.  Excellent choice of subject</td>', 'Awesome!  The sky totally cooperated for you.  Excellent choice of subject', '2007-05-06 11:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620316, 504591, 77364, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I cannot imagine how difficult it was to shoot this butterfly!  Excellent subject matter for this challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  I cannot imagine how difficult it was to shoot this butterfly!  Excellent subject matter for this challenge.', '2007-05-06 11:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620319, 506044, 77364, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject choice.  It would be even more symmetrical if you had taken the photo dead straight on.  Notice how the angle of the right fender is slightly higher than the left?</td>', 'Excellent subject choice.  It would be even more symmetrical if you had taken the photo dead straight on.  Notice how the angle of the right fender is slightly higher than the left?', '2007-05-06 11:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620322, 505695, 77364, '<td valign="top">Good idead.  I like the b/w</td>', 'Good idead.  I like the b/w', '2007-05-06 11:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620324, 506082, 77364, '<td valign="top">Yours turned out much nicer than mine - I had tried this for this challenge too - but ended up not submitting it.  Good thing huh?  Anyway, very nice entry.</td>', 'Yours turned out much nicer than mine - I had tried this for this challenge too - but ended up not submitting it.  Good thing huh?  Anyway, very nice entry.', '2007-05-06 11:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620326, 506177, 77364, '<td valign="top">I hope you are not my next door neighbor - No dandelion''s allowed!  Just kidding.  Excellent submission for this challenge.  I would like to know how you shot this.</td>', 'I hope you are not my next door neighbor - No dandelion''s allowed!  Just kidding.  Excellent submission for this challenge.  I would like to know how you shot this.', '2007-05-06 11:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620329, 506121, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nore contrast maybe?  It''s almost too grey.  But I really like it despite that.  Keep up the good work</td>', 'Nore contrast maybe?  It''s almost too grey.  But I really like it despite that.  Keep up the good work', '2007-05-06 11:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620330, 505869, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nice scene set-up.</td>', 'Nice scene set-up.', '2007-05-06 11:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620333, 505888, 77364, '<td valign="top">Love it - thru this challenge, I discovered that I like more than just the nature photos.  How did you get the sky to appear so uniform?</td>', 'Love it - thru this challenge, I discovered that I like more than just the nature photos.  How did you get the sky to appear so uniform?', '2007-05-06 11:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620336, 505128, 77364, '<td valign="top">My boyfriend would appreciate this one - he''s a volunteer fireman in NJ.</td>', 'My boyfriend would appreciate this one - he''s a volunteer fireman in NJ.', '2007-05-06 11:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620338, 504163, 77364, '<td valign="top">What is it?  I cannot figure it out.</td>', 'What is it?  I cannot figure it out.', '2007-05-06 11:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620339, 506085, 77364, '<td valign="top">This would be great for the next challenge - action.  I have been trying all week to take action shots - I have yet to get one shot that I like - it''s frustrating!!!!  Nice job!  You get very high scores from me</td>', 'This would be great for the next challenge - action.  I have been trying all week to take action shots - I have yet to get one shot that I like - it''s frustrating!!!!  Nice job!  You get very high scores from me', '2007-05-06 11:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620358, 503579, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great look in the eyes of the model and the tangled ropes lead us directly there.  Good composition job!</td>', 'Great look in the eyes of the model and the tangled ropes lead us directly there.  Good composition job!', '2007-05-06 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620366, 505618, 74015, '<td valign="top">The image is kinda soft.  Although it does not feature true symetry, I think it would have done good if the screaming eagle had been tack sharp.  Great catch light in the eye.</td>', 'The image is kinda soft.  Although it does not feature true symetry, I think it would have done good if the screaming eagle had been tack sharp.  Great catch light in the eye.', '2007-05-06 11:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620371, 505381, 77364, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Excellent subject.  It''s not quite symmetrical as it could be - the angle on the right is just a tad more open.  Very nice entry.</td>', 'Awesome!  Excellent subject.  It''s not quite symmetrical as it could be - the angle on the right is just a tad more open.  Very nice entry.', '2007-05-06 11:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620372, 505957, 77364, '<td valign="top">Perfect symmetry.  You did a nice job with an evening shot.  Very nice.</td>', 'Perfect symmetry.  You did a nice job with an evening shot.  Very nice.', '2007-05-06 11:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620396, 505837, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  I don''t know if you just happened to be at the right place at the right time or if this is taged.  Either way, it does a great job with the theme. IMO the light is a little dull but hey! can''t control Mother Nature, now can we?</td>', 'Great capture!  I don''t know if you just happened to be at the right place at the right time or if this is taged.  Either way, it does a great job with the theme. IMO the light is a little dull but hey! can''t control Mother Nature, now can we?', '2007-05-06 11:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620404, 506103, 74015, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetric composition, great color and exposure.</td>', 'Nice symmetric composition, great color and exposure.', '2007-05-06 11:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620409, 505050, 74015, '<td valign="top">No real symmetry here compared to what others have submitted.  Would have been more fitted for submissions in the Rule of thirds challenge.  The colors are a bit dull.  Maybe you could try covnerting to B&amp;W and play with the channels to give it a bit more depth and contrast.  Not a bad shot - just needs a bit of work IMO.</td>', 'No real symmetry here compared to what others have submitted.  Would have been more fitted for submissions in the Rule of thirds challenge.  The colors are a bit dull.  Maybe you could try covnerting to B&W and play with the channels to give it a bit more depth and contrast.  Not a bad shot - just needs a bit of work IMO.', '2007-05-06 11:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620413, 505606, 74015, '<td valign="top">This is lovely - the colors, the saturation of the pink.  I am a bit distracted by the lnely bud on top of the right flower.  Symmetry would have been enhanced if not for that bud.  I love the ray of light that falls onto the right flower.</td>', 'This is lovely - the colors, the saturation of the pink.  I am a bit distracted by the lnely bud on top of the right flower.  Symmetry would have been enhanced if not for that bud.  I love the ray of light that falls onto the right flower.', '2007-05-06 11:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620418, 505951, 74015, '<td valign="top">Symmetric but does not have a real point/story to tell.  The composition with the post right in the middle also make the shot a bit boring.  A different shooting angle would have jazzed it up a bit.</td>', 'Symmetric but does not have a real point/story to tell.  The composition with the post right in the middle also make the shot a bit boring.  A different shooting angle would have jazzed it up a bit.', '2007-05-06 11:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620423, 505007, 74015, '<td valign="top">Not completely symmetric so I will have to note it down vs the other totally symmetric shots.  But I love the sepia treatment and the grain.  I would have loved to see this with a different shooting angle so that the "tower" is not right in the middle.</td>', 'Not completely symmetric so I will have to note it down vs the other totally symmetric shots.  But I love the sepia treatment and the grain.  I would have loved to see this with a different shooting angle so that the "tower" is not right in the middle.', '2007-05-06 11:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620428, 506203, 74015, '<td valign="top">This is a very unusual angle for shooting powerlines.  A bit too wahsed out though...  But because it sticks so well with the challenge theme, I''ll give you more points.</td>', 'This is a very unusual angle for shooting powerlines.  A bit too wahsed out though...  But because it sticks so well with the challenge theme, I''ll give you more points.', '2007-05-06 12:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620436, 503935, 74015, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and I can''t imagine why you would apply a blurring effect to it.  The colors jump out of the sreen, the composition is great.  I don''t understand.  The blurring of the surroundings don''t bother me as much as the blur on the butterfly.  With basic editing, I understand you could not do differently but still... WHY?</td>', 'This is a great shot and I can''t imagine why you would apply a blurring effect to it.  The colors jump out of the sreen, the composition is great.  I don''t understand.  The blurring of the surroundings don''t bother me as much as the blur on the butterfly.  With basic editing, I understand you could not do differently but still... WHY?', '2007-05-06 12:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620439, 504639, 74015, '<td valign="top">I am always impressed by shots like this.  Just the patience you must have to redo it again and again until you catch it just perfect.  I would have preferred if it had not been cropped so tight at the bottom.  The reflection would have given an additional symmetric axis.</td>', 'I am always impressed by shots like this.  Just the patience you must have to redo it again and again until you catch it just perfect.  I would have preferred if it had not been cropped so tight at the bottom.  The reflection would have given an additional symmetric axis.', '2007-05-06 12:07:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3620441, 505165, 74015, '<td valign="top">WOW!!  Shots like this make you feel humble in front of Mother Nature...</td>', 'WOW!!  Shots like this make you feel humble in front of Mother Nature...', '2007-05-06 12:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620446, 505977, 74015, '<td valign="top">To me, this shows that you can shoot a boring subject with a different angle to jazz things up a bit.  Shooting from the ground makes this image really interesting while giving a clean background.  Good job!</td>', 'To me, this shows that you can shoot a boring subject with a different angle to jazz things up a bit.  Shooting from the ground makes this image really interesting while giving a clean background.  Good job!', '2007-05-06 12:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620448, 505600, 74015, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry but where is the focus?  The image looks a bit soft everywhere (or it is just my monitor).</td>', 'Good symmetry but where is the focus?  The image looks a bit soft everywhere (or it is just my monitor).', '2007-05-06 12:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620452, 506132, 74015, '<td valign="top">Your subject is a strong one.  I think it is too bad you included the mirror in the shot if did not intend to use it more to play with the reflection.  Right where it is, I find it distracting from the great subject you chose: the lack of symmetry where we would be expecting it.</td>', 'Your subject is a strong one.  I think it is too bad you included the mirror in the shot if did not intend to use it more to play with the reflection.  Right where it is, I find it distracting from the great subject you chose: the lack of symmetry where we would be expecting it.', '2007-05-06 12:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620453, 505979, 42179, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalism - 7</td>', 'Nice minimalism - 7', '2007-05-06 12:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620455, 505521, 74015, '<td valign="top">Very efficient, nice crop that creates an additional horizontal symmetric axis.</td>', 'Very efficient, nice crop that creates an additional horizontal symmetric axis.', '2007-05-06 12:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620458, 505974, 74015, '<td valign="top">Infrared?  Lovely shot.</td>', 'Infrared?  Lovely shot.', '2007-05-06 12:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620460, 505762, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great title.</td>', 'Great title.', '2007-05-06 12:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620463, 503115, 74015, '<td valign="top">I think the symmetry of your shot would have been better featured if you chess game had been leveled.  The curve at the bottom of the shot, the blue fabric at the top are distracting and take away from your shot.</td>', 'I think the symmetry of your shot would have been better featured if you chess game had been leveled.  The curve at the bottom of the shot, the blue fabric at the top are distracting and take away from your shot.', '2007-05-06 12:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620465, 505776, 74015, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and color.</td>', 'Wonderful light and color.', '2007-05-06 12:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620469, 504436, 74015, '<td valign="top">For the theme of the challenge, I would have preferred a closer shot of the tomb stones, without the lovely, but busy, bay in the background.</td>', 'For the theme of the challenge, I would have preferred a closer shot of the tomb stones, without the lovely, but busy, bay in the background.', '2007-05-06 12:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620472, 505239, 74015, '<td valign="top">I like the shot and the title is just perfect.</td>', 'I like the shot and the title is just perfect.', '2007-05-06 12:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620480, 505083, 74015, '<td valign="top">Love the 2 symmetric axis of your composition.</td>', 'Love the 2 symmetric axis of your composition.', '2007-05-06 12:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3620496, 505732, 74015, '<td valign="top">Great image but too soft.</td>', 'Great image but too soft.', '2007-05-06 12:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
