(3621526, 504960, 76198, '<td valign="top">Very pretty flowers; the lighting is a bit harsh, however, and the background is very distracting.</td>', 'Very pretty flowers; the lighting is a bit harsh, however, and the background is very distracting.', '2007-05-06 19:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
