(3621534, 504455, 76198, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot; meets challenge, but not hugely interesting to me. I find the bird in the shot distracting too.</td>', 'Pretty shot; meets challenge, but not hugely interesting to me. I find the bird in the shot distracting too.', '2007-05-06 19:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621541, 505050, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea for the challenge, but with poor execution. <br/> <br/>What I like - <br/> <br/>the minimalist composition<br/>the unusual take on symmetry<br/> <br/>What I don''t like - <br/> <br/>not a lot of interest in the subjects<br/>lighting is poor</td>', 'This is a good idea for the challenge, but with poor execution.  What I like -  the minimalist compositionthe unusual take on symmetry What I don''t like -  not a lot of interest in the subjectslighting is poor', '2007-05-06 19:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3621544, 504236, 76198, '<td valign="top">very pretty, but oversaturated, I think... And the composition is a little balanced for me.</td>', 'very pretty, but oversaturated, I think... And the composition is a little balanced for me.', '2007-05-06 19:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
