(3624488, 503352, 76198, '<td valign="top">The darkness at the bottom doesn''t work for me, and the you''ve got some severe sharpening artifacts that are quite distracting. Good job with the clouds; nice a moody.</td>', 'The darkness at the bottom doesn''t work for me, and the you''ve got some severe sharpening artifacts that are quite distracting. Good job with the clouds; nice a moody.', '2007-05-07 13:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624494, 505385, 76198, '<td valign="top">I dig this lots. Great color and texture, and I love the wide angle effect.</td>', 'I dig this lots. Great color and texture, and I love the wide angle effect.', '2007-05-07 13:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624516, 504218, 76198, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and could be good, but you have some severe technical problems. <br/> <br/>The photo isn''t level, which is very distracting. <br/>The exposure in the opening is not good; it''d be nice to see more of the walls. <br/>Most importantly, your color balance is way off... The moss is electric green, the water is purple, and so forth... You may have had the wrong white balance setting on the camera? <br/> <br/>If I were taking this shot I would (a) fix the color problem and (b) move into the tunnel so it just frames the opening at the far end - not include the nearer opening in the shot. But that''s just my opinion...</td>', 'Meets the challenge and could be good, but you have some severe technical problems.  The photo isn''t level, which is very distracting. The exposure in the opening is not good; it''d be nice to see more of the walls. Most importantly, your color balance is way off... The moss is electric green, the water is purple, and so forth... You may have had the wrong white balance setting on the camera?  If I were taking this shot I would (a) fix the color problem and (b) move into the tunnel so it just frames the opening at the far end - not include the nearer opening in the shot. But that''s just my opinion...', '2007-05-07 13:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624556, 506202, 76198, '<td valign="top">This would work better if the headstock were truly vertical - it''s leaning slightly to the left. You also got a bit of a self-portrait in there...</td>', 'This would work better if the headstock were truly vertical - it''s leaning slightly to the left. You also got a bit of a self-portrait in there...', '2007-05-07 13:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624565, 505928, 76198, '<td valign="top">Lighting is quite harsh, and the subject and composition are, frankly, not very interesting.</td>', 'Lighting is quite harsh, and the subject and composition are, frankly, not very interesting.', '2007-05-07 13:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624612, 506132, 76198, '<td valign="top">I want to like this photo, and I applaud you taking on a difficult subject. Unfortunately the technicals in this photo are not very good, and I can''t ignore that... <br/> <br/>It appears to have been lit through a venetian blind; this is causing subtle horizonal stripes throughout. The robe is far too reflective, and has many blown out parts. Focus is poor and the image is noisy. <br/> <br/>Hope this isn''t too harsh... I wish you and your model the best.</td>', 'I want to like this photo, and I applaud you taking on a difficult subject. Unfortunately the technicals in this photo are not very good, and I can''t ignore that...  It appears to have been lit through a venetian blind; this is causing subtle horizonal stripes throughout. The robe is far too reflective, and has many blown out parts. Focus is poor and the image is noisy.  Hope this isn''t too harsh... I wish you and your model the best.', '2007-05-07 14:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624620, 504797, 76198, '<td valign="top">I really love the slight grain in the bokeh. Really beautiful.</td>', 'I really love the slight grain in the bokeh. Really beautiful.', '2007-05-07 14:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624635, 505381, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is really great and a perfect shot for the challenge. The colours and composition are excellent. I have, if I may, a very minor criticism: I think if you''d cropped slightly tighter, cutting the person off on the right and the wall and people off on the left you would have had THE most perfect symmetrical image. Good luck, you''ll do well with this anyway.</td>', 'This is really great and a perfect shot for the challenge. The colours and composition are excellent. I have, if I may, a very minor criticism: I think if you''d cropped slightly tighter, cutting the person off on the right and the wall and people off on the left you would have had THE most perfect symmetrical image. Good luck, you''ll do well with this anyway.', '2007-05-07 14:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624640, 504848, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, great colours and symmetry.</td>', 'Beautiful, great colours and symmetry.', '2007-05-07 14:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624646, 505882, 52549, '<td valign="top">I notice you set the ducks in perfect symmetry with regards to the background (kitchen paper?). Good colours and a good eye for detail here.</td>', 'I notice you set the ducks in perfect symmetry with regards to the background (kitchen paper?). Good colours and a good eye for detail here.', '2007-05-07 14:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624653, 505606, 52549, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry here. The colours are nice too. The only tiny nit-pick I have is the small distracting space on the right corner of the frame.</td>', 'I like the symmetry here. The colours are nice too. The only tiny nit-pick I have is the small distracting space on the right corner of the frame.', '2007-05-07 14:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624656, 503368, 52549, '<td valign="top">Perfect symmetry (I counted the pipes;-). Great colours and a good subject.</td>', 'Perfect symmetry (I counted the pipes;-). Great colours and a good subject.', '2007-05-07 14:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624676, 506041, 52549, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, the metal pipes with the coloured drops work well. The only criticism I have is the clashing colours of the red drops in the foreground on the crimson background.</td>', 'I like this a lot, the metal pipes with the coloured drops work well. The only criticism I have is the clashing colours of the red drops in the foreground on the crimson background.', '2007-05-07 14:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624682, 505754, 52549, '<td valign="top">Simple and subtle.</td>', 'Simple and subtle.', '2007-05-07 14:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624958, 503368, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. The colors and the perspective are great.</td>', 'Very cool shot. The colors and the perspective are great.', '2007-05-07 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3624960, 506189, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and detail.</td>', 'Great perspective and detail.', '2007-05-07 16:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625250, 505842, 78110, '<td valign="top">like RHCP hehe cool!</td>', 'like RHCP hehe cool!', '2007-05-07 17:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625712, 506132, 74979, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is a self portrait or not, but the model is a brave woman!  no matter how this finishes in the challenge, CONGRATS to her for making it through her treatment, and for having the COURAGE to stand there for all of us to view.  this is a very powerful image, and you did a great job, B&amp;W, the lighting, compostion, contrast..would love to see her face would be all I would have done differently, but that may have been her choice...<br/>STRONG STRONG WOMAN!!  wishing you well~</td>', 'I don''t know if this is a self portrait or not, but the model is a brave woman!  no matter how this finishes in the challenge, CONGRATS to her for making it through her treatment, and for having the COURAGE to stand there for all of us to view.  this is a very powerful image, and you did a great job, B&W, the lighting, compostion, contrast..would love to see her face would be all I would have done differently, but that may have been her choice...STRONG STRONG WOMAN!!  wishing you well~', '2007-05-07 19:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3625832, 506132, 34059, '<td valign="top">I will add my comment to the many I''m sure you received... this picture is painful to look at, surely not as painful as being the model, and I think that this will make people vote it low. I''m giving it a 6, because I think that the editing is very good, as it gives the image a non-real touch, which is so much necessary to look at it. Taking a picture of the breast only would have given the image more of a symmetry taste, but I think that seeing more of the body gives it a sense of history... the model is sadly and courageously reveiling her secret, she is shy, tired and hoping, and I can see all of this even without seeing her face. Her pose is so eloquent! <br/>The subject is a very hard to photograph and to see. I think that a different shot could have made it easier to look at it, maybe trying to hide a little bit more of what we don''t want to see. But in that case it would have been completely different and maybe the picture would not have been as powerful as it is. Anyway I think that a picture should be a pleasant thing to look at, and this is not. I hope she will do well and that her difficult path is over.</td>', 'I will add my comment to the many I''m sure you received... this picture is painful to look at, surely not as painful as being the model, and I think that this will make people vote it low. I''m giving it a 6, because I think that the editing is very good, as it gives the image a non-real touch, which is so much necessary to look at it. Taking a picture of the breast only would have given the image more of a symmetry taste, but I think that seeing more of the body gives it a sense of history... the model is sadly and courageously reveiling her secret, she is shy, tired and hoping, and I can see all of this even without seeing her face. Her pose is so eloquent! The subject is a very hard to photograph and to see. I think that a different shot could have made it easier to look at it, maybe trying to hide a little bit more of what we don''t want to see. But in that case it would have been completely different and maybe the picture would not have been as powerful as it is. Anyway I think that a picture should be a pleasant thing to look at, and this is not. I hope she will do well and that her difficult path is over.', '2007-05-07 19:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626455, 505762, 76198, '<td valign="top">Colors are not as vibrant as I''d like... Nice composition.</td>', 'Colors are not as vibrant as I''d like... Nice composition.', '2007-05-07 22:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626469, 503592, 76198, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the idea of the abstraction; I think it doesn''t work on a couple of levels, though; <br/> <br/>1st, there''s no focal point to the image; my eye wanders but can''t find a place to rest. <br/> <br/>2nd, since most of the flowers are in focus, the bunches close to the camera that aren''t are distracting. <br/> <br/>I''d rather see one flower, or a few, in focus much closer to the camera, and the background a blur from yellow to blue.</td>', 'I really like the colors and the idea of the abstraction; I think it doesn''t work on a couple of levels, though;  1st, there''s no focal point to the image; my eye wanders but can''t find a place to rest.  2nd, since most of the flowers are in focus, the bunches close to the camera that aren''t are distracting.  I''d rather see one flower, or a few, in focus much closer to the camera, and the background a blur from yellow to blue.', '2007-05-07 22:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626483, 505541, 76198, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and light; I like the sense of the mass of the bridge and the juxtaposition of the soft mist with the hard concrete. <br/> <br/>I do feel like it''s missing a certain "pop"... not sure why. Perhaps more contrast would help? Not sure. 8.</td>', 'Very nice color and light; I like the sense of the mass of the bridge and the juxtaposition of the soft mist with the hard concrete.  I do feel like it''s missing a certain "pop"... not sure why. Perhaps more contrast would help? Not sure. 8.', '2007-05-07 23:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626502, 503248, 76198, '<td valign="top">Very simple and beautiful. I love graffiti, great DOF, 4 wonderful colors, great overall.  I do feel like your focal plane is maybe a foot in front of the railing? Not sure. Not a big deal.</td>', 'Very simple and beautiful. I love graffiti, great DOF, 4 wonderful colors, great overall.  I do feel like your focal plane is maybe a foot in front of the railing? Not sure. Not a big deal.', '2007-05-07 23:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626517, 506143, 76198, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but not terribly intersting. A closer crop and less centered composition might help. Turf grass almost never makes a good background IMHO.</td>', 'Nice colors, but not terribly intersting. A closer crop and less centered composition might help. Turf grass almost never makes a good background IMHO.', '2007-05-07 23:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626528, 503401, 76198, '<td valign="top">Crazy - I got the other pic with the same title just 5 pics ago! Both are quite beautiful; this one appeals to my water resources engineering background. 9.</td>', 'Crazy - I got the other pic with the same title just 5 pics ago! Both are quite beautiful; this one appeals to my water resources engineering background. 9.', '2007-05-07 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626533, 506024, 76198, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - I love the couple of chairs that are out of place. Nice capture.</td>', 'Beautiful - I love the couple of chairs that are out of place. Nice capture.', '2007-05-07 23:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3626550, 505844, 76198, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting attempt, but you need to fix the colors. Also it''s too small - use all the pixels you''re allowed!</td>', 'This is an interesting attempt, but you need to fix the colors. Also it''s too small - use all the pixels you''re allowed!', '2007-05-07 23:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
