(3627644, 502904, 59905, '<td valign="top">This seems to have nothing to do with the challenge. In this challenge, I''d suggest to take a picture of a single leaf, because they are symmetric and look great. Also, I do not like the DOF, probably liked it if that was really shallow. Also, have a look at the Rule of Thirds tutorial. -1-</td>', 'This seems to have nothing to do with the challenge. In this challenge, I''d suggest to take a picture of a single leaf, because they are symmetric and look great. Also, I do not like the DOF, probably liked it if that was really shallow. Also, have a look at the Rule of Thirds tutorial. -1-', '2007-05-08 06:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
