(3631152, 504628, 54446, '<td valign="top">Too bad you tried to influence the voting of others by trashing the LLR and FM images. Congratulations on your 104th place "win".  My advice is to present your best effort to the challenges, and then try to avoid the attempts to drag down others in an effort to somehow lift your own.  Is your "knock down" approach the way of the Netherlands?.</td>', 'Too bad you tried to influence the voting of others by trashing the LLR and FM images. Congratulations on your 104th place "win".  My advice is to present your best effort to the challenges, and then try to avoid the attempts to drag down others in an effort to somehow lift your own.  Is your "knock down" approach the way of the Netherlands?.', '2007-05-09 01:19:33.000000', NULL, 0),
