(3631189, 504544, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wow, Gosh, Yay!!!!!  Thank You! Its 5.15 in the morning here in York, and I don''t think I shall be going back to sleep...<br/> <br/><i></i>Edit:  Oops, meant to put this in the photo description part.<i></i><i></i> <br/> <br/>Jeni, Yanko, BergieKat, Richard and RMS, thank you so much for your words of congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-09 00:39:36.</i></td>', 'Wow, Gosh, Yay!!!!!  Thank You! Its 5.15 in the morning here in York, and I don''t think I shall be going back to sleep... Edit:  Oops, meant to put this in the photo description part.  Jeni, Yanko, BergieKat, Richard and RMS, thank you so much for your words of congratulations!', '2007-05-09 01:28:30.000000', '2007-05-09 01:39:36.000000', 0),
