(3631320, 505695, 67258, '<td valign="top">One of my three 10s in this challenge - I felt you really nailed it with this one (but glad you didn''t get the blue ;¬P); I would love to be able to take something this good.</td>', 'One of my three 10s in this challenge - I felt you really nailed it with this one (but glad you didn''t get the blue ;¬P); I would love to be able to take something this good.', '2007-05-09 01:48:55.000000', NULL, 0),
