(3631341, 505846, 67258, '<td valign="top">"I really like this shot so I''m quite sure it won''t do well...."<br/>We all proved you wrong!  I have looked at this a couple of times during voting; it really is very good.  I do wonder if you re-shot it, it might be worth trying to psition the seeds at the edge of the glass so that they are completely against the black background - the idea may be a logistical non-starter, but may be worth considering.  Either way, I love this one!</td>', '"I really like this shot so I''m quite sure it won''t do well...."We all proved you wrong!  I have looked at this a couple of times during voting; it really is very good.  I do wonder if you re-shot it, it might be worth trying to psition the seeds at the edge of the glass so that they are completely against the black background - the idea may be a logistical non-starter, but may be worth considering.  Either way, I love this one!', '2007-05-09 01:57:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631347, 505846, 48928, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot Irene, way to go!</td>', 'This is an awesome shot Irene, way to go!', '2007-05-09 02:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631353, 505768, 68504, '<td valign="top">Like the crisp white fences, and dark line of not yet fully leaved trees just about as much as the idea of a dandelion lane.  Good angle too.</td>', 'Like the crisp white fences, and dark line of not yet fully leaved trees just about as much as the idea of a dandelion lane.  Good angle too.', '2007-05-09 02:02:53.000000', NULL, 0),
