(3631375, 505776, 67258, '<td valign="top">57th place? I gave this one of three 10s, and I still love it just as much as I did when I first viewed it. I certainly had expected to see this in the top 10 - you will have to remain content that you have produced a photograph that has pleased a great many people, is frame worthy, and can stand alone on it''s own merits outside of any themed challenge.</td>', '57th place? I gave this one of three 10s, and I still love it just as much as I did when I first viewed it. I certainly had expected to see this in the top 10 - you will have to remain content that you have produced a photograph that has pleased a great many people, is frame worthy, and can stand alone on it''s own merits outside of any themed challenge.', '2007-05-09 02:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631381, 505695, 54985, '<td valign="top">very different :) congrats!</td>', 'very different :) congrats!', '2007-05-09 02:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631384, 505837, 36999, '<td valign="top">Be careful or you might end up with a challenge protfolio full of arabs!  (like me)  <br/>I was pretty sure I had seen that before in ROT....  gotta love it when they are predictable whe you need it!</td>', 'Be careful or you might end up with a challenge protfolio full of arabs!  (like me)  I was pretty sure I had seen that before in ROT....  gotta love it when they are predictable whe you need it!', '2007-05-09 02:09:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631400, 505695, 64994, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!! Fantastic shot!<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Congrats!!! Fantastic shot! Jack', '2007-05-09 02:13:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631401, 503728, 67258, '<td valign="top">I had expected this to do better in the ranking - it was in my top 10, but I suspect that you are right in your supposition that it is too ''simple'' for a challenge entry.  I guess also that the marks on the background may have damaged the score, although once they are ther there isn''t a lot you can do in basic editing.  Good work, and I may take this idea and see if I can recreate it as I desperately need to learn lighting techniques.<br/>You have made an excellent start to life on DPC - looking forward to more of your entries in due course.</td>', 'I had expected this to do better in the ranking - it was in my top 10, but I suspect that you are right in your supposition that it is too ''simple'' for a challenge entry.  I guess also that the marks on the background may have damaged the score, although once they are ther there isn''t a lot you can do in basic editing.  Good work, and I may take this idea and see if I can recreate it as I desperately need to learn lighting techniques.You have made an excellent start to life on DPC - looking forward to more of your entries in due course.', '2007-05-09 02:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631408, 505869, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love this shot Deb, and so wished it had done much better for you.....<br/>The tones are just beautiful, and it has a magical feel to it.....<br/>Wonderful textures, and love the angle from which you took this as well.<br/>Great composition, and in all just a really lovely image here.....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-09 01:31:44.</i></td>', 'I love this shot Deb, and so wished it had done much better for you.....The tones are just beautiful, and it has a magical feel to it.....Wonderful textures, and love the angle from which you took this as well.Great composition, and in all just a really lovely image here.....', '2007-05-09 02:16:07.000000', '2007-05-09 02:31:44.000000', 0),
(3631413, 506008, 68504, '<td valign="top">One of the few (if any other) reflections that speaks "symmetry."  I love the shape it makes the way you rotated it.  Good capture, design, light and colour.  Perfect title.</td>', 'One of the few (if any other) reflections that speaks "symmetry."  I love the shape it makes the way you rotated it.  Good capture, design, light and colour.  Perfect title.', '2007-05-09 02:17:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3631420, 504848, 54985, '<td valign="top">should have done better! but good job anyway :)</td>', 'should have done better! but good job anyway :)', '2007-05-09 02:19:37.000000', NULL, 0),
