(3632247, 504628, 61961, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote in this challenge, but looking through the entries I was struck by this thumbnail.  I think your chrome bars need sharper focus, but aside from that, this is a first entry you can be proud of.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry reading previous comments to see you''ve already had some controversy!  As you know now, it is best not to talk about types of entries, especially during the challenge.  On the other hand, the question about "the way of the Netherlands" was inappropriate and rather bizarre.  Probably just a comment dashed off in anger, so don''t let it bother you.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/></td>', 'I didn''t get to vote in this challenge, but looking through the entries I was struck by this thumbnail.  I think your chrome bars need sharper focus, but aside from that, this is a first entry you can be proud of. I''m sorry reading previous comments to see you''ve already had some controversy!  As you know now, it is best not to talk about types of entries, especially during the challenge.  On the other hand, the question about "the way of the Netherlands" was inappropriate and rather bizarre.  Probably just a comment dashed off in anger, so don''t let it bother you. Cheers,', '2007-05-09 09:38:27.000000', NULL, 0),
