(3748495, 504436, 20530, '<td valign="top">The symmetry doesn''t jump out at me; but this image does speak of juxtaposition. It seems as though the wall and fence serve to barricade the cemetery from the world of the living. I like how the random vertical white shapes of the sails are contrasted with the orderly white vertical shapes of the headstones. Everything in the foreground is neat and tidy while the world just beyond is random and chaotic. Nice image.</td>', 'The symmetry doesn''t jump out at me; but this image does speak of juxtaposition. It seems as though the wall and fence serve to barricade the cemetery from the world of the living. I like how the random vertical white shapes of the sails are contrasted with the orderly white vertical shapes of the headstones. Everything in the foreground is neat and tidy while the world just beyond is random and chaotic. Nice image.', '2007-06-06 18:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
